VALUES(9472363, 'CW9903085', '2017-07-05 08:00:00.000', '<pre><b>2017-07-05 12:27:42</b> ** TRI252501 **<br>The following information was written and received by ACDSS beeper worker Chris Offutt, but entered into CHESSIE by this worker. 

On July 3,2017 at 6:45 PM, I received a page from Civil Defense requesting I call the ER at the WMRC at 240-964-1200. I called and spoke to Samantha Wampler, nurse. She advised they have Marvella KellerMckenzie, DOB: 6-27-17 in the ER today brought here by the mother Maggie Keller of 407 Grand Avenue, Cumberland--240-979-7477. Caller advised the child fell off of a table today at home. The report given to them is the baby was in a bouncer on top of the table sleeping when the child''s aunt came up and touched the child''s foot which startled the baby who made a movement causing the bouncer''s one leg to come off of the table, and the baby fell with it. The mother advised the aunt caught the bouncer, but the child did fall onto the floor. Staff examined child and found no evidence of injuries and do not suspect child abuse but are concerned why a parent would put their child in a bouncer on a table. Caller feels maybe DSS can visit and educate the parent. The child''s mother lives in the home with her father.  I advised caller I will write up concerns and send them to CPS supervisor. </pre>', NULL, NULL, '7e8941ee-bddb-4ce0-90a9-8a67a22d3165', NULL, '2024-05-01 18:14:28.214', '7e8941ee-bddb-4ce0-90a9-8a67a22d3165', '2024-05-01 18:14:28.214', '7e8941ee-bddb-4ce0-90a9-8a67a22d3165', 'pending', '{"sdm": {"isar": true}, "DAType": {"DATypeDetail": [{"reason": "", "Summary": "", "DAStatus": "Accepted", "comments": "", "DaTypeKey": "d207bdd4-f281-4ec8-949c-8fd9657227f9", "supStatus": "", "GroupNumber": null, "supComments": "", "DasubtypeKey": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "GroupComment": null, "intakeAction": "", "issubtypekey": true, "DADisposition": "Scrnin", "ReasonforDelay": "", "supDisposition": "Scrnin", "GroupReasonType": null, "dispositioncode": "Scrnin", "ServiceRequestNumber": "CW9903085", "intakeserreqstatustypekey": "Completed", "supMultipleDispositionDropdown": [], "intakeMultipleDispositionDropdown": []}]}, "agency": "CW", "General": {"Time": "2024-0